  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Do <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>≤</mo><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, hay <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>22</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Vậy chiều cao của mực nước tại bến cảng cao nhất bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>22</mn></semantics></math> m khi <div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tPhát biểu đã cho đúng.</li><li>Chiều cao của mực nước tại bến cảng thấp nhất bằng <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>6</mn></semantics></math> m khi\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>π</mi><mo>⇔</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>k</mi><mspace width=\"0.167em\"/><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>ℤ</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tMà <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></mrow></semantics></math>. Vậy lúc <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>18</mn></semantics></math> giờ thì chiều cao của mực nước biển tại bến cảng là thấp nhất.<br>Phát biểu đã cho sai.</li><li>Xét phương trình\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mn>14</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>sin</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mi>π</mi><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><